flowchart LR
  Source[Authored domain source] --> Core[Core canonical IR]
  Core --> View[Derived numerical search state]
  View --> Export[Competition export]
  View --> Bounds[Derived current AABBs]
  Bounds --> SBSH[Graph BoundsIndex via bounded stdio adapter]
  SBSH --> SAT[Official float SAT precheck]
  SAT --> Export
  Export --> Verify[Unchanged official verifier]
  Verify -->|accepted and improved| Best[Checkpointed incumbent]
  Verify --> Evidence[CSV and JSON evidence]
  Data[Official quantum data] -->|supplied locally on 26 October| Quantum[Quantum baseline reproduction]
  Core --> Invocation[Pinned quantum operator and precision contracts]
  Invocation --> Generator[Official kickmix generator]
  Generator --> QuantumVerify[Full official quantum verification]
  Quantum --> QuantumVerify
  QuantumVerify --> Evidence
  Core --> Gates[Typed gate hyperedges and explicit port roles]
  Gates --> Semantics[Bounded unitary execution and inverse]
  Gates --> Complex[Complex64 execution and true adjoints]
  Gates --> Rotor[Explicit U1 phase and f64 Clifford even-subalgebra rotor]
  Rotor --> Matrix[Complex U2 operator comparison]
  Matrix --> Equivalence
  Complex --> Equivalence
  Core --> LatticePlan[Bounded norm shell and target operator]
  LatticePlan --> Lattice[Exact small integer shell enumeration]
  Lattice --> Ortho[SBSH 4D integer orthtree range query]
  Ortho --> NormCheck[Exact norm and phase-sensitive acceptance]
  NormCheck --> Prototype
  Semantics --> Equivalence[Full input-subspace amplitude and phase check]
  Equivalence --> Portfolio[Certified implementation portfolio]
  Portfolio --> PGraph[Existing P-graph MSG and ABB]
  Portfolio --> Resources[Complete-circuit count depth qubits and Q times D]
  Resources --> PGraph
  Resources --> Berge
  Portfolio --> Berge[Existing forward and reverse Berge search]
  Semantics --> Entropy[Reduced-state entropy trace]
  PGraph --> Prototype[Prototype JSON and figure]
  Berge --> Prototype
  Entropy --> Prototype
  Family[Generated direct piecewise polynomial family] --> IntegerScreen[All official inputs: integer arithmetic screen]
  IntegerScreen --> CoefficientIR[Core coefficient models and Query projection]
  CoefficientIR --> ResourceSBSH[SBSH resource dominance queries]
  ResourceSBSH --> NativePgraph[Existing MSG ABB and Berge macro selection]
  NativePgraph --> NativeBuild[Rebuild native circuit from selected Core model]
  NativeBuild --> OfficialFull[Unchanged full official metric]
  OfficialFull --> NativePackage[Package only verified improved bytes]
  Physics[Hamiltonian residuals norm and SOS gap] --> ResourceSBSH
  FactorSpace[SVD rank and orthogonal factor rotations] --> Physics
  DecoderBudget[Coherent EEA iteration proposals] --> Confidence[Official confidence and repetition penalty]
  Confidence --> NativePgraph
  QromSpace[Chunked unary QROM workspace] --> ResourceSBSH
